## Project structure

```
github-code-analyzer/
├── .claude-plugin/
│   └── plugin.json          ← Plugin marketplace manifest
├── .github/
│   └── workflows/
│       └── ci.yml           ← CI: lint, type-check, test, security scan
├── server/
│   ├── __init__.py
│   ├── main.py              ← MCP server entry point (8 tools)
│   ├── analyzer.py          ← Static analysis (models, routes, imports, services)
│   ├── diagrams.py          ← Mermaid diagram generators (6 types)
│   ├── github_client.py     ← GitHub API client with retry / back-off
│   └── security.py          ← Input validation + sanitisation
├── tests/
│   ├── conftest.py          ← Shared fixtures
│   ├── test_security.py     ← Input validation tests
│   ├── test_analysis.py     ← Analyser unit tests
│   ├── test_diagrams.py     ← Diagram generator unit tests
│   └── test_integration.py  ← Full pipeline tests (mocked HTTP)
├── examples/
│   └── sample_output.md     ← Example diagrams from django/django
├── .gitignore
├── .mcp.json                ← MCP server wiring
├── CHANGELOG.md
├── CONTRIBUTING.md
├── LICENSE                  ← MIT
├── manifest.json            ← MCPB bundle manifest
├── pyproject.toml           ← Packaging, pytest, ruff, mypy config
├── README.md
└── SECURITY.md
```

